```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant API as Portfolio API
    participant Cache as Redis Cache
    participant Service as PortfolioAnalyzer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant CEE as CEE Service

    Client->>API: GET /api/v1/portfolio/analytics?org_id=123
    API->>Cache: Check cache (key: portfolio:123:start:end)

    alt Cache HIT
        Cache-->>API: Return cached result
        API-->>Client: 200 OK (cached, <200ms)
    else Cache MISS
        Cache-->>API: No cached result
        API->>Service: generate_portfolio_view(org_id, filters)

        Service->>DB: Query sessions with filters
        Note over DB: SELECT * FROM sessions<br/>WHERE org_id = ?<br/>AND created_at BETWEEN ?<br/>WITH JOIN options, votes
        DB-->>Service: List[Session] (45 sessions)

        Service->>Service: Calculate metrics<br/>(avg time, quality, satisfaction)
        Service->>Service: Cluster analysis<br/>(TF-IDF + K-means)
        Service->>Service: Detect bottlenecks<br/>(rule-based heuristics)
        Service->>Service: Calculate health score<br/>(0.4*velocity + 0.3*quality + 0.3*engagement)

        Service->>CEE: Generate strategic insights
        Note over CEE: LLM prompt with<br/>portfolio context
        CEE-->>Service: List[insight]

        Service-->>API: PortfolioAnalysis object
        API->>Cache: Store result (TTL: 5 minutes)
        API-->>Client: 200 OK (2.1s)
    end

    Note over Client,CEE: Performance: p95 latency = 2.1s for 100 sessions
```

**Description**: Portfolio analytics request-response flow showing cache-first strategy, database aggregation, clustering analysis, and CEE integration.
